Given: (Left) R % C * E 3 K 6 $ 7 D @ 2 T Y # 4 5 G &amp; S (Right)

Now, Remove all the letters from the series.

Remaining series: % * 3 6 $ 7 @ 2 # 4 5 &amp;

Now, counting from the right: % * 3 6 $ 7 @ 2 **#** 4 5 &amp;

So, the fourth element from the right is #

Hence, the correct answer is **Option 1.**

